            "review_title": "Review at Lim Veggie Bistro",
            "review_text": "erin m\nPerth, Australia27 contributions\n0\nVegetarian restaurant\nMay 2026 • Friends\nLim Vegetarian Restaurant is such a beautiful spot, perfect for a catch up with friends or a cozy romantic dinner for two. The food was absolutely excellent, and the service was both genuinely friendly and very professional.\n\nI really love the way the restaurant is decorated and how much care they put into every little detail. You can tell everything is thoughtfully done, right down to the sauces paired with each dish. The passionfruit sauce with the mango salad was incredible, and the hot pot dipping sauce was honestly one of my favourite parts of the meal.\n\nAlthough they don’t serve alcohol, they do support BYO, which is great if you’d like to bring your favourite wine or beers along with dinner.\n\nHighly recommend for anyone wanting to explore delicious, healthy vegetarian food in a lovely atmosphere.\nRead more\nWritten May 21, 2026",
            "rating": 5.0,
